WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Actual UI still. Start at ULX3S U1/J16 copper.
Only the selected isolated joint is computed.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Declare the hypothetical process inputs.
Compare 40 and 56 nL at a 300 µm held gap.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
At 300 µm, only 40 nL meets the numerical fixture rule.
Physical force accuracy remains unqualified.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Change only held gap to 330 µm. Both now meet that rule.
Two sampled gaps do not establish process tolerance.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
Inspect the current candidate inputs and signed forces.
An input edit clears the result and its exports.

00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
Plan matching hot-force and input measurements.
The existing 200 µm fixture needs adaptation for this joint.
